OL,3,GNEWSAWatch gifted by Cary Grant sells
OL,4,Afor #6,800
OL,5,
OL,6,FA gold watch gifted by Cary Grant to
OL,7,Fthe woman who cared for his mother
OL,8,Fduring her final years has sold at
OL,9,Fauction for #6,800.
OL,11,FAuctioneers at Clevedon Salerooms, in
OL,12,Fnorth Somerset, said the watch had been
OL,13,Fa thank you gift to Maggie Leach and
OL,14,Fthe item had been passed down to her
OL,15,Fgreat niece, Stephanie Balson.
OL,17,FBalson said the actor "still came to
OL,18,Fvisit great auntie Maggie" after his
OL,19,Fmum died and visited Bristol regularly
OL,20,Fbefore his death in 1986, at the age of
OL,21,F82.
OL,23,APub: 10-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
